  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components and adjust pH to 7.0. Distribute the medium into tubesor bottles under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers, and autoclave. After cooling, add per liter (final) the following solutions fromsterile anaerobic stocks (autoclaved or *filter--sterilized):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Readjust pH of the medium to 7.0, if necessary."
    }
  ]
}